<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>NO</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">DAMONA</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">NO</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">5rQRlpzMm87QNGCi1Ydbpv</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">4 Contributors</p><p ttm:agent="v1">NO Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Intro]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Woah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ripped jeans, greasy hair, sittin' on a couch (Hey)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">High headphone volume level, being in is out (Hey)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Pierced nose, pierced lips, but I'm not gonna tell you where (Uh-huh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Flying over centuries with music in her ears</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She's singin', "Woah, I'm not gonna do that, no</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It's not gonna happen, woah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Go fuck yourself</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Hey, go fuck yourself</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Woah, I'm not gonna do that, no</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It's not gonna happen, woah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Go fuck yourself</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Hey, go fuck yourself"</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 2]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Makeup, no job, cruising through the town (Mm)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Someone is complaining 'cause the sound is way too loud (Hey)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Goin' out and goin' down, and then, oh, press repeat (Hey)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It's her against the world, and one word is all she needs</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She's singin', "Woah, I'm not gonna do that, no</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It's not gonna happen, woah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Go fuck yourself</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Hey, go fuck yourself</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Woah, I'm not gonna do that, no</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It's not gonna happen, woah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Go fuck yourself</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Hey, go fuck yourself"[Bridge]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Please, please, please repeat yourself</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I didn't get what you were sayin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1">What, what, what did you say?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">No, I don't care, I'm just playin', I'm just playin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She's singin', "Woah, I'm not gonna do that, no</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It's not gonna happen, woah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Go fuck yourself</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Hey, go fuck yourself</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Woah, I'm not gonna do that, no</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It's not gonna happen, woah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Go fuck yourself</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Hey, go fuck yourself"</p></div></body></tt>